    <briefdescription>
<para>Orchestrates multi-modal retrieval-augmented generation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Retrieves text and image documents using caller-supplied functions, fuses results via RRF, generates captions for image sources, and builds a formatted context string for downstream LLM consumption.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">MultiModalRAGConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.enable_image_retrieval<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1multimodal_1_1_multi_modal_r_a_g_1aed77bc71f9180c652740a605f29c6e7e" kindref="member">MultiModalRAG</ref><sp/>mm_rag(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mm_rag.setTextRetriever([&amp;](</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>q,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">size_t</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>k)<sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mm_rag.setImageRetriever([&amp;](</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::vector&lt;float&gt;&amp;<sp/>e,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">size_t</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>k)<sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mm_rag.setImageCaptioner([&amp;](</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ImageDocument&amp;<sp/>img)<sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
